%% section: Who does what, one turn at a time
flowchart TB
    A["Token streaming with safety on the path"] --> B{"When do you screen?"}
    B -->|"Input only"| C["Fast, but the output is unchecked"]
    B -->|"Full output, then send"| D["Safe, but streaming is gone — user waits for everything"]
    B -->|"Incrementally, as it streams"| E["Screen each chunk before releasing it"]
    E --> F{"A later chunk trips the classifier"}
    F --> G["Earlier tokens are already on the user's screen"]
